      "$comment": "Final UTF-8 JSON <=5 MiB per part, NOT per record set. Every legal slot plus header fits one part. Part size and group integrity are separate checks: common metadata, complete 1..partCount, no duplicate identity/revision, fixed snapshot. Import unknown/history slots without requiring current content. Never restore metadata counters from backup."
    }
